  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0: the rules now also ship as the EFDoctor.Analyzers package, which runs them in every build and in the IDE. Two new rules, for 24 in all: EFD037 reports entities loaded when only a few columns are read, and EFD038 reports ExecuteUpdate or ExecuteDelete that leaves tracked entities stale. EFD002 and EFD019 now follow a result stored in a local, and EFD002 is renamed. See CHANGELOG.md in the package.",
